+    }
+
+    // s46 rung 5 -- the idleClip token (RENDER-RIG.md's own open item): an OPTIONAL per-entry override
+    // of WHICH discovered clip plays as the idle, for creatures whose animList[0] (discovery order, not
+    // curated) isn't their best look. Parse shape mirrors ResolveFolkloreDisplay (split on the FIRST
+    // ':'; a colon-less token or any scheme other than "idle" is malformed). FAIL-SOFT LAW (deliberately
+    // DIFFERENT from Display's): a bad idleClip token never degrades the entry to text-only -- the model
+    // and its default idle are both already fine -- it only warns (naming entry+token+why) and falls
+    // back to defaultClip. Resolution is restricted to the DISCOVERED list ONLY: AnimationFactory has
+    // already attached every name in `discovered` to this exact model (EnsureFolkloreModel, just above
