+    // s46 rung 4 -- the LIVE (animated) counterpart to GatherFolkloreStaticBounds, called from
+    // LateUpdate. Renderer.bounds is already a WORLD-space AABB (unlike sharedMesh.bounds, which is
+    // mesh-LOCAL and had to be transformed through the renderer's own transform above) -- for a
+    // SkinnedMeshRenderer with updateWhenOffscreen=true (set in EnsureFolkloreModel) this AABB is
